e  Castle and more than likely had numerous  underground tunnels routing to and from  the castle itself prior to the events of  Ocarina of Time the sheikah leader known  as EMPA opened the village to the  general public as a way of masking what  the village once was and the things that  once happened there you see long ago in  the hyrulean civil war there arose those  that would try to dethrone the royal  family who were appointed by highly as  the family destined to protect the  Triforce and the Sacred Realm the  sheikah who are known as the shadow folk  and whose purpose is to protect the  royal family took things into their own  hands when it came to the civil war  enemies of the royal family were not  executed but rather taken to their  secret temple for interrogations or  worse I'm referring of course to the  shadow temple a dungeon that we know was  built by sheikah  based on its symbolism location and the  use of Zelda's Lullaby to unlock key  functions within the dungeon when link  explores the temple in-game you can see  many disturbing artifacts and tools that  were once used by the sheikah themselves  there are large guillotines for  execution of prisoners horrifying  monsters that may have been the result  of failed experiments skeletons whose  spirits linger on acid pools with hands  desperately reaching out and many blood  stains throughout the dungeon the  spirits of the dead within the temple  can be heard sometimes one of the most  memorable quotes from one of these  spirits is about the shadow temple  itself  it describes the shadow temple as a  gathering  Hyrule's bloody history of greed and  hatred there are numerous references to  unknown deities such as these ominous  faces in the walls or the Horned Raven  statues the Raven historically  symbolizes death and the horns are  symbolic of demons in the zelda  franchise like the horn statue in Hatano  village it is possible that the sheikah  worshipped a demon of death in this  place the temple boss bongo bongo the  phantom shadow beast is speculated to  have been a member of the sheikah that  lived in a house located where the well  stands now he is rumored to have either  betrayed or stolen from the royal family  which would have led to his torture on  the devices we see at the bottom of the  well as well as his hands being cut off  which was historically the punishment  for a thief in ancient times he could  also have made a bargain with this death  demon after his passing to then become  the dark spirit bongo bongo which Impa  tried to seal at the bottom of the well  only for him to eventually break out and  be defeated in the shadow temple by the  hero the dark things that happened in  this temple were not ordained by the  royal family at all according to the  Hyrule encyclopedia which reads that  because it stands as a symbol of high  rules dark history it is taboo for the  royal family to speak of this temple in  its horrific purpose we can infer that  the royal family most likely did not  know about its existence and upon  finding out about the horrors that  happened there is the reason why the  temple is inactive and is not used  anymore so how does this brutality  torture and bloodshed relate to the  sheikah technology we see and breath of  the wild a key component to  understanding this is that there is a  certain kind of enemy in the shadow  temple that hasn't appeared in the  timeline before ocarina of time and that  is the redead readouts are zombified  humanoid enemies that are dark brown in  appearance and wear wooden masks in this  game they appear to be blind yet can  still paralyze link with their gaze if  they hear him moving their only drive  seems to be a desire for human flesh  their presence and this unknown dungeon  speaks volumes of the atrocities  committed here the sheikah were  experimenting with their tortured  prisoners they were trying to create  eternal life and they were praying to a  death God to make it happen this may  even explain the existence of luminous  rocks which are infused with the souls  of the dead we also see that they  continue to experiment and improve their  mummification process even after the  royal family shut the shadow temple down  in the Wind Waker the redeads make  another appearance within temples but  this time they're wearing sheikah  jewelry their earrings bear an uncanny  resemblance to the bracelets that the  sheikah monks in breath the wild are  wearing giving the implication that the  sheikah were now experimenting on  themselves the newer redeads could now  see but were still mindless and only  focused on eating the living in breath  of the wild they were eventually  successful in creating redeads also  known as the monks that retained their  memories and knowledge and even created  one monk in particular that seemingly  retained all bodily function and memory  we can see from their end product that  their strivings for eternal life were  noble in the end they used the  culmination of their knowledge to create  the monks that would serve highly a  thousands of years in the future they  appear to have been successful in their  dealings with the dead but at what cost  the shadow temple stands as the reminder  of the sheikh is hatred for the enemies  of the royal family and greed of the  eternal life of the gods even though  their evil deeds ultimately led to their  ability to serve highly along after  death does this justify their dark stain  on Hyrule's history do they still have  secrets hidden under the surface we can  see in breath of the wild if these  topics interest you check out another  video I made a while back about the  sheikah and calamity Ganon I'll link it  in the description below thank you so  much for watching if you enjoyed this  video please leave a like as that will  greatly help the channel out and be sure  to subscribe if you haven't already for  much more juicy content to come leave a  comment letting me know what you think  as I mentioned before October is a time  for spooky stuff so if you want more  spooky Zelda content be sure to stick  around so I've noticed recently that  either you guys are incredibly smart or  I'm just really bad at making these  thumbnail teasers but again it was guest  almost immediately by the user named  Noah in my discord server so Noah  congratulations leave us a comment below  proclaiming your victory to everybody  else and for those of you waiting for  next week's teaser know that I'm  definitely going to be making these  harder from now on I think I know what  I've been missing and I'm going to leave  fewer hands so that less people get it  right  right off the bat huge shout-out to my  newest fan art coming from the user  named either TM or shadow is fine in my  discord server this piece is especially  adorable and may actually be my current  phone background as always Thank You  patreon supporters so much for  supporting the channel and for those of  you in the discord server for letting me  be a witness to your humour theories and  talent if you're interested in the  support tiers or in joining the discord  server and chatting it up with the best  of us then please visit the description  below for links to both of these things  that's all I've got for you today so as  always you guys have a great rest of  your day keep it chilly folks this is  massive and a bandits signing out peace  [Music]
 

